  "body": "<!-- Release notes generated using configuration in .github/release.yml at v0.4.5 -->\n\n## What's Changed\n* fix: compact column widths count characters, not terminal cells by @VXNCXNX in https://github.com/achristmascarl/rainfrog/pull/330\n* fix: yanking all after clearing history panics by @VXNCXNX in https://github.com/achristmascarl/rainfrog/pull/331\n* fix: scrolling past the last favorite panics on the next action by @VXNCXNX in https://github.com/achristmascarl/rainfrog/pull/332\n* fix new clippys by @achristmascarl in https://github.com/achristmascarl/rainfrog/pull/333\n* menu loading skeleton by @achristmascarl in https://github.com/achristmascarl/rainfrog/pull/334\n* feat: allow resizing the focused section by @tridimensionaal in https://github.com/achristmascarl/rainfrog/pull/336\n* unbindable keyboard shortcuts, dynamic hints by @achristmascarl in https://github.com/achristmascarl/rainfrog/pull/337\n* in visual mode, only submit selected text by @achristmascarl in https://github.com/achristmascarl/rainfrog/pull/338\n\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/achristmascarl/rainfrog/compare/v0.4.4...v0.4.5",
